          <p>The human hand consists of 27 small bones — making it one of the most intricate areas to scan and diagnose. Our AI is trained on thousands of hand X-rays to accurately identify fractures, dislocations, and bone deformities, ensuring you never miss a critical diagnosis.</p>
          <table>
