    <a href="/infomation#joints">Learn more</a>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>AI-Powered Detection</h3>
    <p>Analyze your uploaded X-ray in real-time to identify possible fractures instantly.</p>
    <a href="/infomation#AI-Powered">Learn more</a>
  </div>
