    <div class="right">
      <h1>how ai<br>is Revolutionizing Radiology</h1>
      <p>AI is redefining radiology with lightning-fast image analysis, dramatically improving diagnostic accuracy. By leveraging deep learning and computer vision, radiologists can now detect diseases earlier and more reliably than ever before.
      <br><br>Advanced algorithms can identify micro-fractures, tumors, infections, and abnormalities that may go unnoticed by the human eye. AI also assists in image segmentation, classification, and prioritization of urgent cases—streamlining workflows and reducing reporting times.
      <br><br>This revolution brings enhanced care even to under-resourced clinics and helps tackle radiologist shortages by automating routine evaluations and boosting productivity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
